{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Our department's completed classroom pilot found that the OpenMath Core package requires 90 minutes of mathematics intervention per week for the planned student grouping model. This is a significant discrepancy from the draft implementation plan, which currently provides only 60 minutes per week for mathematics intervention. I recorded this finding in the department pilot binder, but I should note that the binder has not yet been uploaded to the adoption folder. I wanted to make sure the group was aware of this before we proceed, as it directly impacts the feasibility of the implementation plan."}
```

